# ---- campaign outputs ---------------------------------------------------------
# `cargo run --example <campaign>` writes its deliverable tree to <family>_system/.
# Those trees are REGENERABLE by the campaign itself (which re-proves every gate on
# every run), so they are not tracked — the one exception is showcase/, above.
*_system/
archive/

